          "description": "Book multiple Royal Mail orders at once and return a single merged PDF containing every label, ready to print. Use this when the user pastes a list of orders/addresses. All orders share the same service, package format and sender. Saves the merged PDF to ~/Downloads/parcel-toolkit/ (overridable via PARCEL_TOOLKIT_LABELS_DIR).",
